  "modified": "2026-11-03T12:52:23Z",
  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: MVG command injection via the SVG decoder\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-56379.patch: add SVGEscapeString() and escape\n       attribute and style values before writing them to the MVG stream in\n       SVGProcessStyleElement() and SVGStartElement(), and escape <text> and\n       <tspan> content for the double quotes it is written between in\n       SVGStartElement() and SVGEndElement() in coders/svg.c\n     - CVE-2026-56379\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: memory leak in the YUV decoder\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-61868.patch: relinquish scanline and destroy\n       chroma_image on blob open failure in ReadYUVImage() in coders/yuv.c\n     - CVE-2026-61868\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: memory leak in the MIFF encoder\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-61869.patch: destroy quantum_info before\n       throwing on pixel and colormap allocation failure in WriteMIFFImage()\n       in coders/miff.c\n     - CVE-2026-61869\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: Additional fix for CVE-2026-106568: unbounded XML\n     entity expansion via nested parameter entities\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-106568-2.patch: refuse entity expansions\n       longer than the \"system:max-profile-size\" policy (16MiB by default)\n       in ParseEntities() in magick/xml-tree.c, add GetMaxProfileSize() to\n       magick/memory.c and set max-profile-size in config/policy.xml\n     - CVE-2026-106568",
